willemw:{n:"Willem Wiebes Hazenberg",d:"c. 1798–1849 · Leek",b:1798,x:1849,s:"h",p:["wiebe", "aafke"],r:["nl"],t:"Born at Leek in the Westerkwartier of Groningen, the country the Hazenberg name comes from. A merchant, he moved to Friesland and married Anna Grabhorn at Smallingerland on 25 May 1839. He died at Bergum on 6 January 1849, aged 51.",src:[["Marriage record, 1839", "https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:899fdae3-ed0b-cfd5-ce74-8f0724fe948c"], ["Death record, 1849", "https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:ecba6ec4-62c5-b3eb-e59e-0cd932211e19"]]},
annagrab:{n:"Anna Catharina Dorothea Christiana Grabhorn",sn:"Anna Grabhorn",d:"c. 1806–1887 · Oldenburg",b:1806,x:1887,s:"h",p:["johanngrab", "eleonora"],r:["de", "nl"],t:"Born in Oldenburg, Germany, around 1806, she brought German ancestry into the Hazenberg line. She married Willem Wiebes Hazenberg in 1839 and died at Bergum on 8 August 1887, aged 81.",src:[["Death record, 1887", "https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:294c5fae-a2d7-5bf6-9a9b-2813b5811988"]]},
wiebe:{n:"Wiebe Willems Hazenberg",d:"c. 1776–1809",b:1776,x:1809,s:"h",p:["willemharms", "lootske"],u:true,r:["nl"],t:"Of Grootegast in the Westerkwartier of Groningen. He married Aafke Gales of Niekerk at Midwolde on 22 April 1798, and they lived at Leek, where Willem (1799), IJnje (1801) and Gale (1803) were born; Lutske followed in 1806. He died at Grootegast early in 1809, about 33, and his last son Wiebe was baptised in May 1809 with the note \"the father has died\". His children all carried the name Hazenberg.",src:[["Marriage, 1798", "https://www.openarchieven.nl/gra:760fb3a7-2562-90d8-8937-d9a6139d9fc4"], ["Baptism of Willem, 1799", "https://www.openarchieven.nl/gra:fec59394-1853-ec7f-709a-24077f7d2d6c"], ["Burial, 1809", "https://www.openarchieven.nl/gra:2f59e3ae-f8da-4ba3-3e77-d737658985e6"], ["Baptism of Wiebe, 1809", "https://www.openarchieven.nl/gra:0c592e93-17f4-9be6-f36e-553a9e0d8180"]]},
aafke:{n:"Aafke Gales",d:"1770–c. 1815",b:1770,s:"h",p:["galeh", "eenje"],u:true,r:["nl"],t:"Baptised at Niekerk on 14 January 1770, the daughter of Gale Harms and Eenje Jans. She married Wiebe Willems in 1798 and named two of her children, IJnje and Gale, after her parents. Widowed in 1809 with five children, she married the shoemaker Bralt Pieters Hovinga at Grootegast in 1810. She died before May 1816. Her son Willem's baptism and marriage records call her \"Aafke Arends\"; his death record gives Aafke Gales.",src:[["Baptism, 1770", "https://www.openarchieven.nl/gra:f7203cee-b324-2ff1-d950-d1b84a778af5"], ["Marriage, 1798", "https://www.openarchieven.nl/gra:760fb3a7-2562-90d8-8937-d9a6139d9fc4"], ["Second marriage, 1810", "https://www.openarchieven.nl/gra:1a425e69-af16-68ef-57a8-04d93680ed87"]]},
