gijsbertjeboer:{n:"Gijsbertje de Boer",d:"Schelluinen",s:"b",p:[],r:["nl"],t:"Wife of Arie de Kreij and mother of Jan Rokus de Kreij. Her granddaughter Gijsbertje de Kreij carried her name."},
henryharvey:{"n":"Henry Augustus Harvey","s":"y","p":[],"r":["au"],"t":"Father of Ethel Augusta Harvey. With Ellen Elizabeth Alcock, a young widow whose first husband, Henry James Wilmott, had died in 1864, he registered four children in country Queensland: Harold Augustus (1866, who died as a baby), Ethel Augusta (1868), Eleanor Frances Hoskins (1870) and Thurza Anne (1874). No marriage for the couple appears in the Queensland index, and nothing more is known of him after 1874; by the end of 1878 an Ellen Elizabeth Harvey was free to marry Arthur James Hosking.","src":[["Queensland BDM historical index","https://familyhistory.bdm.qld.gov.au/"]]},
ellenalcock:{"n":"Ellen Elizabeth Alcock","s":"y","p":[],"r":["au"],"t":"Mother of Ethel Augusta Harvey. As Ellen Elizabeth Alcock she married Henry James Wilmott in Queensland on 4 June 1864, but he died that September, three and a half months after the wedding. With Henry Augustus Harvey she registered four children in country Queensland: Harold Augustus (born January 1866, who died that December), Ethel Augusta (1868), Eleanor Frances Hoskins (1870) and Thurza Anne (1874). On 31 December 1878 an Ellen Elizabeth Harvey married Arthur James Hosking in Queensland; Hosking, or Hoskins, was the middle name she had given her daughter Eleanor eight years before. Arthur James Hosking died in 1894.","src":[["Queensland BDM historical index","https://familyhistory.bdm.qld.gov.au/"]]},
